### CeyGreen E-Commerce Marketplace API samples
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@service = http://localhost:8084
@apiKey = ceygreen-dev-api-key

### Register/login via gateway first (Student 2 user service), then set:
# @farmerToken = <farmer-jwt>
# @buyerToken = <buyer-jwt>
# @farmerId = <uuid>
# @buyerId = <uuid>

### List products (paginated, searchable) — via gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/products?q=tomato&inStock=true&sort=newest&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### Categories / featured / low stock
GET {{gateway}}/api/products/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

GET {{gateway}}/api/products/featured?limit=8
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

GET {{gateway}}/api/products/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### Farmer products
GET {{gateway}}/api/products/farmer/{{farmerId}}?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### Create listing (farmer)
POST {{gateway}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cropName": "Tomato",
  "quantity": 20,
  "unitPrice": 150.00,
  "harvestDate": "2026-08-09",
  "location": "Kandy",
  "description": "Organic greenhouse tomatoes"
}

### Update / delete / patch stock & status
PUT {{gateway}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 25, "unitPrice": 160.00 }

PATCH {{gateway}}/api/products/1/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 10 }

PATCH {{gateway}}/api/products/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }

DELETE {{gateway}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### Batch checkout (buyer) with shipping
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "buyerName": "Nimal Perera",
  "phone": "0771234567",
  "address": "123 Green Lane",
  "city": "Kandy",
  "postalCode": "20000"
}

### Legacy single-item checkout (still supported)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "buyerName": "Nimal Perera",
  "phone": "0771234567",
  "address": "123 Green Lane",
  "city": "Kandy",
  "postalCode": "20000"
}

### Order reads & status
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/my-orders?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/farmer
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

PATCH {{gateway}}/api/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### Farmer dashboard summary
GET {{gateway}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
